    "Id": "chassisdef_gatekeeper_GKP-B",
    "Name": "Gatekeeper",
    "Details": "The Alternate-B is a versatile general-purpose configuration, combining a variety of weapons with an LRM-20 supplied with enough ammunition to make use of specialized munitions. A TAG provides additional utility, allowing the Gatekeeper to designate targets for artillery support even after losing its arm-mounted weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
